      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PARADIGM (8) went back last start then worked home in good style to finish 7 metres from the winner in third at this track over 1790m, that effort following a good win at Globe Derby Park the run prior. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Primary contender if things go her way. ROCKNROLL LENNY (5) was responsible for a far better performance last start when fourth over 1790m at this track, beaten 8 metres, after travelling in the leading division. His recent form is good enough to take out a race like this. RED HOT MIKI (4) was in the money two starts ago then things went wrong last start when he broke and finished 6 metres away in seventh over 1790m at this track. Meets a similar line up so if he behaves a big run is likely. THE AFRICAN QUEEN (3) is worth some thought based on her third over 2190m at this track two runs ago.",
